Gather useful context for current intents and upcoming initiatives: what you have agreed to reach out about soon. Intents are ranked by relevance; prioritize useful new information.

Save findings as you go with save_preparation: include intent IDs, source URLs or provider item IDs, and observation times. Reuse stable finding IDs for updates; editing a finding does not refresh its observations. Keep findings scoped to their intents.

Conversations will use these findings and check current information when the user returns. Leave unavailable sources for then. Stop when there is nothing useful to gather.
